en.description:
Introduction

For our Production division, we are seeking a Finisher (M/F) whose primary role will be to actively participate in the finishing activity of brins and fermoirs components.

Responsibilities

• Ensure polishing and finishing operations across the entire product range;

• Guarantee daily production that meets expectations (quality and quantity) according to set objectives;

• Perform self-control of produced parts.

Profile

• Finisher CFC and/or significant experience in the field of finishing;

• Mastery of polishing techniques: emerying, felt polishing, lapping, polishing, satin finishing, brightening on brins and fermoirs;

• Proven skills in reading plans and dimensional control;

• Knowledge of a computer system related to the profession;

• Strong team spirit, versatility, and flexibility;

• Rigor, organizational sense, consistency, and assiduity.

Conclusion

We offer a stimulating environment, excellent working conditions, flexible working hours, and top-notch social benefits.

We thank you for submitting a complete application file (CV, cover letter, certificates, and diplomas).

de.description:
